 drivers/irqchip/Makefile             |   1 +
 drivers/irqchip/irq-bao1x-intc.c     | 102 ++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/irqchip/irq-bao1x-irqarray.c | 152 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 265 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/irqchip/irq-bao1x-intc.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/irqchip/irq-bao1x-irqarray.c

